    "_comment": "Weekly Echo Gulch overworld (2026-09-29): red-rock badlands below Dustbreak Desert's south wall, between the Autumnal Plains (west) and the Seafoam Coast (east). A dry wash snakes across the middle and flash floods run down it; slot-canyon mazes; whisper stones; the echo makes monsters hear you from further away. North trailhead: Dustbreak's south gate. West and east trails (added to live editions by upgradeFloor) replace the old Plains<->Coast crossing. Band route_levels.echo-gulch. Export with python/export_online_gulch.py.",
