    "features": {
      "_comment": "server/gulch-features.mjs. whispers: whisper stones on the open canyon floors (never in a slot canyon or the wash); walking beside one listens (dive_listen): a rumour, or, if you are visibly wet or messy or smell, gossip about you costing whisper.dignity (scaled by Shame). One listen per stone per cooldown_seconds. flood: every period_minutes a roar warns for warning_seconds, then the wash (floor.wash) floods for flood_seconds; each step in the flood adds wash_wet bladder and soaks soak_slots (clothing penalty, never an accident); the first step into it startles you (startle_wet, once per flood). echo: roaming monsters hear you within pursuit_steps plus crinkle (padded), slosh (wet), squish (messy) and accident (for accident_seconds after an accident), times crawl_percent while crawling, capped at max_reach path steps.",
      "whispers": 6,
      "whisper": {
        "sprite": "sprGulchWhisperStone",
        "span_w": 1,
        "span_h": 2,
        "spacing": 14,
        "cooldown_seconds": 120,
        "dignity": 10,
        "rumours": [
          "...the wash floods every few minutes. Listen for the roar and get up on the banks...",
          "...old Gritt says he'll only let you use his outhouse if you buy something. He's lying. Mostly...",
          "...the hoodoos in the slot canyons aren't all rocks. Crawl past the tall ones...",
          "...sound carries down here. Every crinkle, every slosh. They all come running...",
          "...someone found gold in the Prospector's Camp once. Nobody remembers who...",
          "...the Hush Matron only comes out when it's quiet. It's never quiet...",
          "...the Coast is east, past the wash. The Plains are west. Dustbreak's gate is north, if you can find it...",
          "...the wren tells everyone everything. Don't let it see you..."
        ],
        "about_you": [
          "...did you hear her coming up the wash? Crinkle, crinkle, crinkle, the whole way...",
          "...soaked right through, and it wasn't the flood. Everyone could tell...",
          "...the bats heard it first. Then the wren. Now the whole canyon knows...",
          "...still wearing it, too. You could smell it from the next bend...",
          "...grown adult, waddling round the badlands in a soggy diaper. Bless her...",
          "...she tried to hold it through the slot canyon. She did not make it through the slot canyon...",
          "...listen, listen: that squelch is her. Every step. Squelch, squelch...",
          "...Gritt says she's not allowed on his clean bunks until she's changed..."
        ]
      },
      "flood": {
        "period_minutes": 10,
        "warning_seconds": 30,
        "flood_seconds": 45,
        "wash_wet": 3,
        "startle_wet": 30,
        "soak_slots": [
          "socks",
          "shoes",
          "pants"
        ]
      },
      "echo": {
